s-custom-h6-line-height:var(--textH6Font-line-height);--ricos-custom-h6-font-size:var(--textH6Font-size);--ricos-custom-h6-font-family:var(--textH6Font-family);--ricos-custom-h6-text-decoration:var(--textH6Font-text-decoration);--ricos-custom-h6-color:rgb(var(--textH6Color));--ricos-custom-hashtag-font-style:inherit;--ricos-custom-hashtag-font-weight:inherit;--ricos-custom-hashtag-text-decoration:inherit;--ricos-custom-hashtag-color:rgb(var(--textLinksAndHashtagsColor));--ricos-custom-footer-toolbar-padding-inline-start:var(--ricosFooterPadding);--ricos-custom-footer-toolbar-padding-inline-end:var(--ricosFooterPadding);--ricos-custom-editor-add-plugin-button-position-inline-start:var(--ricosAddPluginButtonStart);--ricos-breakout-normal-padding-start:var(--ricosNormalPadding);--ricos-breakout-normal-padding-end:var(--ricosNormalPadding);--ricos-breakout-full-width-padding-start:var(--ricosFullWidthPadding);--ricos-breakout-full-width-padding-end:var(--ricosFullWidthPadding)"><div class="nSDY8"><div type="first" data-hook="rcv-block-first"></div><div class="boxOz"><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-rxzlk435" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block1"></div><div><h2 class="eYIcO X-Ect N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-evlre578" tabindex="-1"><span aria-hidden="true" id="passer-du-discours-du-concret-evlre578"></span><span class="o457E"><span>...passer du discours à du concret</span></span></h2></div><div type="heading" data-hook="rcv-block2"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-1fqtt916" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block3"></div><div><h3 class="_2AooE X-Ect N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-s7m4p337" tabindex="-1"><span aria-hidden="true" id="on-parle-beaucoup-de-sant-mentale-mais-quand-on-est-en-surcharge-anxieuxse-puise-ou-au-bord-de-la-crise-de-panique-la-question-devient-trs-simple-quest-ce-que-je-peux-faire-l-maintenant-pour-aller-un-peu-mieux-s7m4p337"></span><span class="o457E"><span>On parle beaucoup de santé mentale, mais quand on est en surcharge, anxieux(se), épuisé(e) ou au bord de la crise de panique, la question devient très simple : “qu’est-ce que je peux faire, là, maintenant, pour aller un peu mieux ?”</span></span></h3></div><div type="heading" data-hook="rcv-block4"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-d8us6460" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block5"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-azn4h495" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Cet article propose des repères concrets et réalistes, avec un angle Gestalt (corps, émotions, relation), et un ancrage local : accompagnement en cabinet à Tours ou en visio.</span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block6"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-dtbph339" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block7"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-y3tvu531" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><strong style="font-weight:700"><span>Ce que l’on observe le plus souvent aujourd’hui</span></strong></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block8"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-egwg0567" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block9"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-8r8r2603" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Dans les consultations, les motifs reviennent fréquemment : stress chronique, ruminations, surcharge mentale, sommeil fragilisé, fatigue qui s’installe, difficulté à poser des limites, et parfois attaques de panique.Ce n’est pas un “manque de volonté”. C’est souvent un système qui a tenu trop longtemps, sans récupération suffisante, et sans espace pour déposer.</span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block10"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-8kj16341" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block11"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-yuo7b713" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><strong style="font-weight:700"><span>Le repère Gestalt : revenir à l’expérience (plutôt que rester “dans la tête”)</span></strong></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block12"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-hpstp750" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block13"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-98n8o787" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>La Gestalt-thérapie est une approche centrée sur l’expérience vécue :</span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block14"></div><div><ul class="tQIDd N9T8F"><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:disc"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-2xmvr345" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Ce qui se passe dans le corps (tension, souffle, agitation, fatigue).</span></span></p></li><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:disc"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-3b9gy348" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Ce qui se passe dans l’émotion (peur, colère, tristesse, découragement).</span></span></p></li><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:disc"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-ko7lm351" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Ce qui se passe dans la relation (suradaptation, difficulté à dire non, peur de décevoir, conflits, isolement).</span></span></p></li></ul></div><div type="bulleted_list" data-hook="rcv-block15"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-b3041353" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block16"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-k5zzw864" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>L’idée n’est pas de “tout analyser”, mais de retrouver de la présence et donc des choix. </span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block17"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-sd90l902" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block18"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-kp64k940" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Quand un système se sent un peu plus en sécurité, il respire. </span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block19"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-vfgwr1070" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Et quand il respire, il s’ajuste.</span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block20"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-yqsjn979" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block21"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-xxpmm355" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><strong style="font-weight:700"><span>4 repères concrets qui aident vraiment</span></strong></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block22"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-pry4f1130" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block23"></div><div><ol class="IzyC5 N9T8F"><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:decimal"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-vd36t359" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Repérer le signal précoce (avant le débordement)La plupart des personnes “s’aperçoivent” qu’elles vont mal quand elles sont déjà au bout. Or le corps prévient plus tôt : gorge serrée, souffle court, ventre noué, irritabilité, agitation, épuisement dès le matin, rumination au réveil.Repère utile : “Quel est mon premier petit signe, à moi ?”C’est souvent le meilleur point d’entrée pour agir.</span></span></p><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-4hol51543" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></li><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:decimal"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-csn911317" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Allonger l’expiration (2 minutes)</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-g4x181123" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Quand le stress monte, on cherche souvent à contrôler. Pourtant, le levier le plus simple passe par le rythme :</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-8r9ti365" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Inspirez 3-4 secondes</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-vy88k368" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Expirez 6-8 secondes</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-5w9ni1809" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Pendant 2 minutes</span></span></p><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-hqohm1467" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-g5x0b1615" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Si c’est difficile : soufflez doucement comme dans une paille.</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-opy291911" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Ce n’est pas magique, mais c’est </span><strong style="font-weight:700"><span>un signal de sécurité </span></strong><span>envoyé au système nerveux.</span></span></p><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-alftr1471" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></li><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:decimal"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-judlt374" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Fermer une boucle et poser une limite “tenable”</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-3a4sk2069" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>La surcharge mentale vient aussi des “boucles ouvertes” : tout ce qui reste en attente dans la tête.Exercice simple (10 minutes) : notez tout ce que vous portez, puis triez en 4 colonnes :</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-ur0xq377" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Maintenant (vraiment urgent)</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-ccmil380" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Planifier (date)</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-nlxyl383" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Déléguer / demander</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-xmk4s386" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Stop (à arrêter)</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-myndj2182" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Puis choisissez une seule limite tenable pour la semaine (petite mais tenue).</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-rjx5x2293" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Exemples : “pas de messages pro après 19h”, “une pause sans écran par jour”, “je réponds demain”.</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-uzm9u2571" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Une limite tenue vaut mieux qu’un plan parfait.</span></span></p><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-uwdrf2086" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></li><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:decimal"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-e0wdn389" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Attaque de panique : l’objectif est de traverser la vague</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-wytrl1777" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Pendant une crise, chercher à “se raisonner” fonctionne rarement. Le but est plutôt de revenir aux appuis :</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-hojvq392" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Nommer : “C’est une attaque de panique. C’est très inconfortable, mais ça va redescendre.”</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-xf3uc395" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Expirer long (comme plus haut)</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-jx3bf398" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Revenir au concret : sentir ses pieds au sol, son dos contre le dossier, nommer 5 choses que l’on voitAvec le temps, on travaille surtout la “peur de la peur” (anticipation, évitement), qui entretient les crises.</span></span></p></li></ol></div><div type="ordered_list" data-hook="rcv-block24"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-df50u1972" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block25"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-16t2y2209" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><strong style="font-weight:700"><span>Pourquoi l’accompagnement aide (et ce qu’on fait en séance)</span></strong></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block26"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-xkx7y2012" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Quand ça déborde, on se retrouve souvent seul(e) face à des mécanismes automatiques : tenir, s’adapter, minimiser, repousser, puis craquer.En séance, on travaille sur :</span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block27"></div><div><ul class="tQIDd N9T8F"><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:disc"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-0hzcx404" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>repérer vos signaux précoces</span></span></p></li><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:disc"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-le5yd407" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>retrouver un appui corporel (régulation)</span></span></p></li><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:disc"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-68xko410" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>clarifier vos besoins et vos limites</span></span></p></li><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:disc"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-k5rl9413" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>comprendre ce qui se rejoue dans vos relations (et en sortir)</span></span></p></li><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:disc"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-b9gix416" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>remettre du mouvement là où tout s’est figé</span></span></p></li></ul></div><div type="bulleted_list" data-hook="rcv-block28"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-u4dw4418" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block29"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-3hnz12256" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Cadre des séances (Tours &amp; visio)</span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block30"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-4gzfl2297" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Je vous reçois en cabinet à Tours (22 rue des Halles) ou en visio.</span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block31"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-bkalk2339" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Séance : 45 minutes - 70 €</span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block32"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-nxw0q420" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block33"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-1gs4v3359" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><strong style="font-weight:700"><span>Prendre rendez-vous</span></strong></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block34"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-4l6se2426" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Téléphone : 06 52 14 74 36</span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block35"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-h2l0f2383" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Email : </span><a target="_blank" href="mailto:elisa@gatay.fr" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="kmSaa SKaQD" data-hook="web-link"><u style="text-decoration:underline"><span>elisa@gatay.fr</span></u></a></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block36"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-v4rxh2562" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><a target="_blank" href="/prendre-rendez-vous/" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="kmSaa SKaQD" data-hook="web-link"><u style="text-decoration:underline"><span>Prendre rendez-vous </span></u></a></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block37"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-zvkp8422" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block38"></div><div><div class="JRr-4" id="viewer-ix0r03478" tabindex="-1"><div class="_2z3uq" style="width:min(100%, 367px)"><figure class="hgTH6" data-hook="figure-IMAGE"><div data-hook="image-viewer" class="tgk7r"><div class="cnA7t OiNPy sZt3J" style="--dim-height:2404;--dim-width:2000;--ricos-image-default-border-color:unset" data-hook="image-viewer-ix0r03478"><div class="yqH5Y"><div style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;bottom:0" id="ix0r03478" class="jMNhd"><div id="733c96_c8fa73cac06d443799ab5bf9688b55b5~mv2.jpg" class="undefined o4Fp6" data-motion-part="BG_IMG ix0r03478"><img src="/assets/original/d40c2ccb2a62d61807fd.avif" alt="portrait d&#x27;Elisa" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 50%;max-width:100%;position:absolute;left:0;top:0" draggable="false" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div></div></div></div><button class="ez7OG" type="button" data-hook="image-expand-button" aria-label="Expand image"><svg viewbox="0 0 19 19" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="e-SSD"><path d="M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z" fill="#000" fill-rule="nonzero"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div></div><div type="image" data-hook="rcv-block39"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-ohfvy2704" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block40"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-y11ol4729" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block41"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-h7icj4777" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><strong style="font-weight:700"><span>Important</span></strong></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block42"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-xwt1l2610" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Si vous êtes en danger immédiat, appelez le 15 ou le 112. </span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block43"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-8pqyr2658" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Si vous avez des idées suicidaires, vous pouvez contacter le 3114 (gratuit, 24/7).</span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block44"></div></div><div type="last" data-hook="rcv-block-last"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>
